Package: gfcdash
Type: Package
Title: Interactive Dashboard for Global Forest Change Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Ugyen", "Penjor", email = "ugyen.penjor@fauna-flora.org",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides an interactive Shiny dashboard for uploading or drawing
    an Area of Interest (AOI), downloading and thresholding the relevant
    Hansen et al. Global Forest Change (GFC) tiles, computing year-by-year
    forest cover and loss statistics, and building classified change maps,
    multi-panel comparison maps, and time-series animations. Designed so
    users with no R experience can launch the full analysis with a single
    function call.
